### Attempt B — fresh workspace

Workspace: `vivado/system/vitis_standalone_build_hls6c_20260728_run2`  Platform: `snn_replay_platform_hls6c_run2_20260728`  Application: `snn_replay_app_hls6c_run2_20260728`

